; a[p[i]] = b[i]: no runtime alias check can be built (aliasing); the scatter store is
; also indirect (secondary stride).
; Source: void cantrt(float *a, float *b, long *p, int n) { for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) a[p[i]] = b[i]; }
